[33m          "The Atlanta Hawks defeated the Philadelphia 76ers, 123 - 121, at Wells Fargo Center on Friday evening. The [0m  
[33mHawks (13 - 29) knew they were facing an uphill battle coming into the contest, given both their futile road record and [0m
[33mthe quality of their opponent. However, their chances received a boost shortly before tip - off when it was revealed [0m   
[33mthat Joel Embiid (ankle) would miss the contest for the 76ers (27 - 16). Atlanta did come out of the gates hot and [0m     
[33mtrailed just 56 - 54 at the half. The Hawks would then hold the lead for substantial portions of the second half, and [0m  
[33mthey made an impressive comeback from a 121 - 118 deficit with under a minute remaining. Kevin Huerter knotted the game [0m
[33mat 121 with 54 seconds remaining, a basket John Collins followed up with a 13 - footer with 10 seconds left. Jimmy [0m     
[33mButler then missed two free throws and both Ben Simmons and Wilson Chandler misfired on tip shots in the closing seconds[0m
[33mto seal the wild win for the visitors. Huerter led the way for the Hawks with 29 points, adding three rebounds, three [0m  
[33massists and two steals. Collins contributed 25 points, nine rebounds, two assists and one steal. Dewayne Dedmon produced[0m
[33m19 points, eight rebounds, seven assists and one steal. Trae Young supplied 18 points, five assists, four rebounds and [0m 
[33mtwo steals. De'Andre Bembry delivered 14 points, six boards, five assists and one steal. Alex Len and Jeremy Lin co - [0m  
[33mled the bench with nine points apiece. Butler paced the 76ers with 30 points and supplemented them with five assists, [0m  
[33mfour rebounds and three steals. Simmons finished with 23 points, 15 assists, 10 rebounds, two steals and one block. J.J.[0m
[33mRedick poured in 20 points while also tallying two assists, one rebound and one steal. Mike Muscala started for Embiid [0m 
[33mand offered 16 points and three rebounds among his contributions. T.J. McConnell matched Muscala's scoring and also [0m    
[33mdished out six assists, pulled down three rebounds and recorded two steals. The Hawks head back home and face the [0m      
