[33m18 from long range. The Pacers (1 - 1) will be right back in action as they play host to the Nets on Saturday. The Bucks[0m
[33m(20) play host to the Knicks on Monday.": "Knicks",[0m                                                                     
[33m          "The Milwaukee Bucks defeated the visiting Atlanta Hawks, 115 - 107, at Fiserv Forum on Sunday evening. The [0m  
