[33m          "Jimmy Butler_('The Philadelphia 76ers defeated the Los Angeles Lakers, 143 - 120, at Wells Fargo Center on [0m  
[33mSunday afternoon. The Lakers (28 - 28) were fresh off a miracle win over the Boston Celtics on Thursday night, but they [0m
