[33massist, one steal and one block. Brandon Ingram tallied 19 points, four rebounds and four assists. LeBron James [0m        
[33mcontributed 18 points, 10 boards and nine assists. Reggie Bullock had just two points over 31 minutes in his team debut.[0m
[33mJoel Embiid paced the 76ers with a 37 - point, 14 - rebound double - double that also included three assists and one [0m   
